<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vail Resorts started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vail Resorts started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Jill Krutick has started coverage of Vail Resorts Inc with a rating of outperform, a source at the brokerage said Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Vail, Colo., ski resort company closed Wednesday at 20-3/4.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
